{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":159300,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2102.073926,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":4262.012518,"text":"Lions are the most sociable cats, "},{"kind":"audio","t":4313.510841,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":4314.9466999999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":4315.616637,"samples":2264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":5825.7464709999995,"text":"Les lions sont les chats les plus sociables, vivant en grand groupe, populés meutes."},{"kind":"text","t":5993.253647,"text":"living in large groups, called prides. "},{"kind":"audio","t":6032.822913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6034.26423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":6034.480015,"samples":7664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":7002.237233000001,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":9190.909198000001,"text":"In the Middle Eastern Kumasho, "},{"kind":"audio","t":9241.773338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9242.943417,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":780},{"kind":"text","t":10183.043029,"text":"the house was not that important. "},{"kind":"audio","t":10232.932283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10234.225177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":10234.344566000002,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":10528.088042000001,"text":"Dans le Kumasho du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"route","t":11401.444738,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":16667.361184,"text":"Almost all the stones are sandy and allow for safe swimming. "},{"kind":"audio","t":16724.183372,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16725.823028000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16727.614191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":16727.887372,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":18160.149072,"text":"Presque tous les pirages sont sablonneux et permettent de se baigner en toute sécurité, la plupart sont ombragés par des pollues du coq à boire."},{"kind":"text","t":18366.374925,"text":"Most are shaded by drinking-cock pollutes. "},{"kind":"audio","t":18419.641818,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18421.207852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18421.399501,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":19401.600589,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"input","t":24834.617649,"text":"Les meutes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes, apparentés ainsi que d'une trentaine de femelles et de lionceaux."},{"kind":"text","t":25200.924361,"text":"The prides consist of one to three related adult males, as well as about thirty females and cubs. "},{"kind":"audio","t":25258.823008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25260.488662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25262.137722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":25263.890267000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25265.684715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":25265.957626,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":25801.612391000002,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":28960.709285,"text":"Feral children may have suffered serious "},{"kind":"audio","t":28998.719177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":29000.289639000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":29000.416679,"samples":5264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":31718.647814000004,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir suivi de graves abus ou traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"text","t":31926.395255000003,"text":"abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away. "},{"kind":"audio","t":31982.78263,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31984.358208999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31986.191395,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":31986.322583,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":32501.087457,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":35735.207077,"text":"The Scotterb 403 bus runs regularly "},{"kind":"audio","t":35775.994265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35777.261119,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35779.15052,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":35779.249189,"samples":3696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":38725.950984,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scotturb se rend régulièrement à Sintra, avec un arrêt à Cabo d'Aroca."},{"kind":"text","t":39009.524648,"text":"to Sintra, with a stop at Cabo d'Aroca. "},{"kind":"audio","t":39060.114065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39061.811247,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39062.291138,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"route","t":39901.939060000004,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":42143.465277,"text":"To admire the most beautiful panoramas of Hong Kong, "},{"kind":"audio","t":42184.452726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42185.910188,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42187.871277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":42188.020081,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":45104.586074,"text":"leave the island and head to the waterfront "},{"kind":"audio","t":45154.575588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":45156.251378,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":45156.706572,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":46646.264003000004,"text":"Pour admirer les plus beaux panoramas de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et rejoignez le front de mer de Kowloon situé en face."},{"kind":"text","t":46768.77379,"text":"of Kowloon located opposite. "},{"kind":"audio","t":46808.234073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":46809.758194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":46809.878445,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":47801.959897,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":49979.731473,"text":"Aristotle's opinions on all questions. "},{"kind":"audio","t":50031.11265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50032.830703,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":50032.989142,"samples":11264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":53924.875845,"text":"scientific, including psychology, "},{"kind":"audio","t":53975.205681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53976.505987000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":53976.617995,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54119.965453000004,"text":"Les opinions d'Aristote sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la psychologie, ont été acceptées."},{"kind":"text","t":54205.541747,"text":"were accepted. "},{"kind":"audio","t":54242.258043,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":54242.467538,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":55701.701034,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":59886.756389,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gourlay finished 11th in the Super G, "},{"kind":"audio","t":59939.82979,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59941.001132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":59943.135611,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":59943.256302,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":60803.950179,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gourlay est arrivé 11e au Super G Debout Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":60921.94053,"text":"Stand up, man. "},{"kind":"audio","t":60970.790141,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":60970.915099,"samples":10432,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":61601.549185,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":65871.769214,"text":"The Czech Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th in the "},{"kind":"audio","t":65911.255265,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65912.873899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":65913.222704,"samples":19064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":66300.52997199999,"text":"Le tchèque Aldrich Jelinek s'est classé 16e au Super JIC Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":66450.57431,"text":"Men's Super-G. "},{"kind":"audio","t":66501.32003199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66501.565941,"samples":13432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"route","t":67902.128359,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":70991.006763,"text":"The city contrasts sharply with the cities of the "},{"kind":"audio","t":71029.342305,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71030.799416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":71031.54052,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"text","t":73987.21445599999,"text":"rest of the country because it has a style "},{"kind":"audio","t":74039.29357299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":74040.85329799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":74040.995883,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75120.72036499999,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les cités du reste du pays car elle possède un style davantage arabe qu'africain."},{"kind":"text","t":75240.024232,"text":"more Arabic than African. "},{"kind":"audio","t":75276.857334,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75277.441022,"samples":24832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"route","t":76500.84075599999,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":78664.20475799999,"text":"Also, after the Revolution, "},{"kind":"audio","t":78714.93894299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78716.104425,"samples":30832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"text","t":80688.445484,"text":"the trades were opened to all male candidates. "},{"kind":"audio","t":80726.89216199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80728.31255799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":80728.795204,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":83965.733461,"text":"Aussi, après la Révolution, les métiers furent ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus talentueux de réussir."},{"kind":"text","t":84147.58410299999,"text":"allowing the most ambitious and talented to succeed. "},{"kind":"audio","t":84200.40212099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":84201.83066899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":84203.645628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":84203.73999999999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":85201.788754,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":88396.279738,"text":"The fission bomb works according to the following principle. "},{"kind":"audio","t":88449.44292399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":88450.859054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88452.69873999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":88452.817518,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":92478.36164999999,"text":"It transforms energy by assembling a nucleus of a myriad of "},{"kind":"audio","t":92533.36308099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92534.98511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92536.795772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":92537.528404,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":92772.784537,"text":"La bombe à fission fonctionne selon le principe suivant. Elle transforme l'énergie en assemblant un noyau d'une myriade de protons et de neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":92889.587483,"text":"protons and neutrons. "},{"kind":"audio","t":92938.73727499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92939.315124,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"route","t":94001.446904,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":96190.88295799999,"text":"He did not quantify his reductions, "},{"kind":"audio","t":96241.259515,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96242.808374,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":96242.91119799999,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":98607.31860099999,"text":"Il n'a pas chiffré ces réductions, disant qu'elles seront basées sur la production économique chinoise."},{"kind":"text","t":98834.86038499999,"text":"saying that they will be based on Chinese economic production. "},{"kind":"audio","t":98875.90300699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98877.260528,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98879.040054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":98879.18089599999,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":99602.175897,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":103827.012767,"text":"There is no universal definition that allows for determining "},{"kind":"audio","t":103880.81378299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103882.21323699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":103884.054335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":103884.468478,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":106311.32282599999,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle permettant de déterminer si un objet manufacturé est une antiquité."},{"kind":"text","t":106478.26687499999,"text":"whether a manufactured object is an antiquity. "},{"kind":"audio","t":106518.296123,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106519.63738999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106520.775591,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"route","t":107501.99424,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":111716.01126099999,"text":"Some tax authorities define goods over 100 "},{"kind":"audio","t":111755.83057399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111757.153603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":111758.96075,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":111759.05027499999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112685.67775999999,"text":"Certains organismes fiscaux définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans comme des antiquités."},{"kind":"text","t":112803.77707499999,"text":"years old as antiques. "},{"kind":"audio","t":112854.436747,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":112855.02089599999,"samples":24232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"route","t":113901.50829299999,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":117189.70806799999,"text":"You don't necessarily need a yacht in the archipelagos. "},{"kind":"audio","t":117241.34068299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117243.366048,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117244.70765499999,"samples":31664,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":117728.816836,"text":"Vous n'avez pas forcément besoin d'un yacht dans les archipels et sur les lacs."},{"kind":"text","t":117846.033464,"text":"and on the lakes. "},{"kind":"audio","t":117883.88560899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":117884.15431299999,"samples":8632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":118602.459863,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":120915.150684,"text":"It is therefore said that the aspect ratio of this "},{"kind":"audio","t":120966.827696,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120968.19344999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":120969.236087,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"text","t":122901.405734,"text":"format is obtained by dividing by 12 to get the most "},{"kind":"audio","t":122953.937932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122955.981615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122957.579868,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":122957.76301299999,"samples":7296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":125240.42759699999,"text":"On dit donc que le rapport d'aspect de ce format en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le plus simple des rapports de nombre entier est de 3 sur 2."},{"kind":"text","t":125444.910389,"text":"simple integer ratio is 3 to 2. "},{"kind":"audio","t":125496.661352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":125498.235349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":125498.54342199999,"samples":13664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":126702.05065599999,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":129920.03683699999,"text":"Its reputation as an epicenter of luxury began "},{"kind":"audio","t":129959.811472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129961.225939,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129962.21418499999,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"text","t":131943.971231,"text":"around the year 400 and lasted until "},{"kind":"audio","t":131996.75507699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131998.331087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":131999.320575,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":132232.515048,"text":"Sa réputation en tant qu'épicentre du luxe a débuté aux environs de l'an 400 et a duré jusqu'à 1100 environ."},{"kind":"text","t":132387.484642,"text":"around 1100. "},{"kind":"audio","t":132436.374913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132437.276399,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"route","t":133101.702556,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":135313.93047999998,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, "},{"kind":"audio","t":135351.448833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135352.682528,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"text","t":136303.126143,"text":"but starting from the end of March, "},{"kind":"audio","t":136340.301881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136341.56478,"samples":31432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"text","t":138253.387052,"text":"most cancellation policies based on the "},{"kind":"audio","t":138302.98298499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138304.680607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":138304.82213,"samples":12464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":141303.797304,"text":"coronavirus do not extend until July 2020, "},{"kind":"audio","t":141344.871924,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":141346.40311699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141348.173368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141348.532418,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":143834.88137299998,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais à partir de fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation basées sur le coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux Olympiques avaient été prévus."},{"kind":"text","t":144054.717701,"text":"the date for which the Olympic Games had been scheduled. "},{"kind":"audio","t":144106.575525,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144108.317144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144109.058428,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"route","t":145601.792926,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":148824.320986,"text":"mix the two dry powders together and then with the "},{"kind":"audio","t":148876.136627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148877.52053799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148878.344166,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":150523.907749,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches ensemble puis avec les mains propres et humides, pressez-les en une boule."},{"kind":"text","t":150744.684381,"text":"clean, damp hands, press them into a ball. "},{"kind":"audio","t":150784.589903,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150786.03023899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":150786.655099,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"route","t":151601.50899,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":155487.553148,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time spent in the "},{"kind":"audio","t":155527.270067,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155528.76309199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155529.569284,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"text","t":157626.033715,"text":"city. "},{"kind":"audio","t":157673.83975699998,"samples":30000,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":860},{"kind":"text","t":158750.321995,"text":"Cruise passengers are exempt from visa requirements. "},{"kind":"audio","t":158789.397819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158790.928341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158792.634937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":158792.74115699998,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":159058.540234,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps passé dans la ville. Les passagers des croisières sont exemptés de l'obligation de visa, voire les conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":159163.756979,"text":"see the conditions. "},{"kind":"audio","t":159217.42192999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159217.691746,"samples":14032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"close","t":169303.552981,"code":1005}]}